@host = http://localhost:5071
@apiKey = partner-api-key-2026

### Create Partner Transaction (valid payload)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "partnerId": "P-1001",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-99823",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}

### Create Partner Transaction (invalid — missing fields)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "partnerId": "",
  "transactionReference": "",
  "amount": -10,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}

### Create Partner Transaction (no API key — should return 401)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerId": "P-1001",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-99823",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}

### Mock Partner Verification (internal, no auth required)
GET {{host}}/internal/mock-partner/P-1001

### Health Check
GET {{host}}/health
